<Legal title="Privacy Policy" updated="23 July 2026" description="How Sentezy collects, uses and protects your data.">
  <p>
    This policy explains what Sentezy collects when you use the service, why we collect it, and
    the choices you have. It applies to the Sentezy website and app.
  </p>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    Sentezy makes vertical videos from a product link or a few sentences, using synthetic
    presenters, voices, captions and music. For questions about your data, write to
    <a href="mailto:hello@sentezy.ai">hello@sentezy.ai</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Account details</b> — your email address and password when you sign up.</li>
    <li><b>What you give us to make a video</b> — product links, uploaded photos and clips, and the scripts you write or approve.</li>
    <li><b>The videos we make for you</b> — the rendered files and the choices behind them, such as the presenter, voice and captions.</li>
    <li><b>Usage data</b> — basic logs about how the service is used, so we can keep it running and fix problems.</li>
    <li><b>Payment data</b> — handled by our payment provider. We never see or store your full card number.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To make and deliver the videos you ask for.</li>
    <li>To run your account and count your credits.</li>
    <li>To take payment when you buy more credits.</li>
    <li>To keep the service secure and to improve it.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <p>
    We use a small number of trusted providers to run Sentezy: cloud hosting, a payment processor,
    and the AI services that generate the voice, the presenter images and the script. They only
    receive what they need to do their part, and they may not use your content for anything else.
    We do not sell your data.
  </p>

  <h2>Where it is stored and how we protect it</h2>
  <p>
    Your scripts, uploads and rendered videos are encrypted in transit and at rest. Access is
    limited to what is needed to run the service.
  </p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>
    We keep your content while your account is open. You can delete your account and all of its
    media at any time from Settings; once deleted, it is removed from active systems.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    In line with KVKK and GDPR, you can ask to see the data we hold about you, correct it, delete
    it, or object to how we use it. To make a request, write to
    <a href="mailto:hello@sentezy.ai">hello@sentezy.ai</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    We use only the cookies needed to keep you signed in and to run the site. We do not use them
    to track you across other websites.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    If this policy changes, we will update the date at the top of this page.
  </p>

  <p class="legal-note">
    This is a plain-language summary written for the product. Have it reviewed by a lawyer before
    launch, and confirm the contact address is one you monitor.
  </p>
</Legal>
